            "titulo_en": "The madeiro",
            "rotulo_en": "",
            "historia_en": "On the night of the 24th, in many inland areas such as Beira Baixa, Guarda and Trás-os-Montes, the madeiro burns in the churchyard: a great bonfire where people gather after Midnight Mass. Traditionally, it is the young men who bring the logs.",
