            "titulo_en": "Merry Christmas",
            "rotulo_en": "Christmas",
            "historia_en": "Today there is no piece and no suggestion. There is the table, the family and what is given without wrapping. Thank you for opening these doors of Portuguese gold with us, day by day. Tomorrow we return with myrrh: the care that comes after the gift. Merry Christmas from all of us at Gold Store Premium’s 13 stores.",
